ries of her father that she will carry with her forever.\n\nNow, as the shy Fuu enters her first year of high school, she once again takes up her father’s old camera, determined to take wonderful pictures that will bring joy and happiness to others.\n\n(Source: Nozomi Entertainment)"},"tags":[{"name":"Iyashikei","rank":98,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Photography","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cute Girls Doing Cute Things","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rural","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Outdoor Activities","rank":50,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Tamayura: Hitotose","english":"Tamayura: Hitotose","native":"たまゆら～hitotose～","romaji":"Tamayura: hitotose","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"玉响～hitotose～"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"幸福光斑"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"玉响～1年～"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}